  "primary_sample_rule": "exactly two calibration and two test cases per governed family, selected lexicographically with unique source task groups and jointly with the development pilot to preserve zero source, task-group, or lineage overlap; case bindings include exact source, program, manifest, witness, construct-firewall, license, privacy, lineage, packet, and regeneration commitments",
